{"id":"no-todos-somos-iguales-tmdb-1373789","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"No todos somos iguales","overview":"Tras liberarse de una larga y tóxica relación, Fernanda se embarca en una escapada de fin de semana con tres amigos en busca de consuelo y distracción. Sin embargo, lo que comienza como una evasión pronto se convierte en un torbellino de tensión y agendas ocultas; a medida que las verdaderas intenciones del grupo salen a la luz, Fernanda se ve obligada a enfrentarse a la realidad de la que tanto intentaba escapar.","releaseDate":"2026-12-31","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t413ZB032NAlMYMJuGEERuOY3O7.jpg","genres":["Drama"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish"],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Valentina Buzzurro","role":"Fer","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txrPFGzDTqJErpNiNdx7J0aKQv2.jpg","personTmdbId":1309519,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Patricio Gallardo","role":"Sebas","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5W5ZMambtkzpr1REPxu7yBeaqMY.jpg","personTmdbId":2017737,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Sebastián Olmos","role":"Chema","personTmdbId":4368277,"department":"Art"},{"name":"Alphonso Escobedo","role":"Lolo","personTmdbId":4596907,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Antonio Monroy","role":"Don Toño","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kV2DMkExJ26SCTap134DTqXwv8c.jpg","personTmdbId":62477,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Sabrina Rubio","role":"Princesa","personTmdbId":5010345,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Sidney Robote","role":"Napo","personTmdbId":2218470,"department":"Acting"}],"crew":[{"name":"Sergio Nolasco","role":"Director","personTmdbId":3205853,"department":"Directing"},{"name":"Sergio Nolasco","role":"Screenplay","personTmdbId":3205853,"department":"Writing"},{"name":"Moisés Pérez Pineda","role":"Screenplay","personTmdbId":5010354,"department":"Writing"},{"name":"Sergio Nolasco","role":"Writer","personTmdbId":3205853,"department":"Writing"},{"name":"Moisés Pérez Pin